Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.76,0:00:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Music plays. I look up\Nto the stars and reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,for the sky I believe\Nin tomorrow if we try!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the music!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the good times!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the good times!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, baby, baby,\Nalways share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see for you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the darkness\Nthat is in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So hard to see, but to believe\NIn where we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you and me, it's true that we\NFeel the rush brought on by this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Through head to feet, I feel the\Nbeat Getting me to walk on, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, take my hand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:00:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.90,0:01:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.96,0:01:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, as we chase, we're being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,From the top we go on straight and wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way. I've got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.78,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here it starts, so don't lose heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,From boot to hood, I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be free to be, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.48,0:01:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.06,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times,\Nshare the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.60,0:01:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.02,0:02:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.56,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon it will be you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.98,0:02:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.94,0:02:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.22,0:02:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.28,0:02:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a loud crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.87,0:02:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I seeing things, or is that a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.76,0:02:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What is a man doing on our island?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shroud yourself from his\Nleering gaze. Huh? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My secret is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.44,0:02:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He saw my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.02,0:02:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we mustn't let him\Nleave the castle alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:02:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.55,0:02:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I just saw her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.54,0:03:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, it's kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.48,0:03:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I've\Nseen that somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What you saw is a secret\Nwe would die to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, one that we would kill to\Nprotect in this particular instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.46,0:03:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Secret? That thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it a secret? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Take those questions\Nto the grave with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.68,0:03:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Love, love, beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.94,0:03:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a slow, slow beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.70,0:03:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's making space noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Love, love, beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't he transform into stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.52,0:04:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he doesn't feel any\Nexcitement after seeing me in the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am without flaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.34,0:04:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's simply beyond\Nthe realm of possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The sublime grandeur of your nude form\Ncan irreparably beguile any creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.06,0:04:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,His fear of death must be overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The impure urge is within him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a pitiful coward,\Nbut he's a lucky one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep talking about dying, so bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just looking for\Nsomeone important to talk to!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,From this high up, he's out of his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now pistol kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't bounce off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of bullets were those?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That man is a dangerous intruder!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuja Pirates, go forth and capture him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.47,0:04:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.72,0:04:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How did a man even get here? Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just go and catch the bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of me, you stupid snakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of snakes are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They feel like they're made of iron!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.98,0:05:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems luck is against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope they skip the\Ninterrogation and kill him right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But they'll kill him no\Nmatter what, won't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's with this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They were joking when they said\Nthere aren't any men around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.26,0:05:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for my explanation\Nnow. Specifically,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to know how you got onto\Nthis island and what you want here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.05,0:05:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just as confused as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.54,0:05:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I got sent flying through the sky, and\Nthe next thing I knew, I landed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,An unlikely story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:06:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lying to me will only guarantee you\Nan excruciatingly painful death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here because you want something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, I could really use a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it'd be better if you guys\Ncould just give me a lift, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.82,0:06:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm in a pretty big hurry,\Nand I need to get going right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the boss around here, right, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does this disrespectful\Npup think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The snake princess is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.46,0:06:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That story is clearly an\Nimpossible fabrication.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.44,0:06:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's plotting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't deceive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We can get back up and keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.16,0:06:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way that you will\Nleave this island is by dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.40,0:06:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and your departure is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.06,0:06:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Snake Princess, he's not lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.26,0:07:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how this must sound,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't believe this man is the\Nkind of person who can tell a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.42,0:07:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe he's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This man is incapable of anything\Nbut a childlike sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I honestly don't think he would ever\Ntry to inflict any harm upon our land.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.10,0:07:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you didn't really want to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of our warriors, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my name is Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Given that men are forbidden\Nhere under penalty of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,he sealed his fate the moment\Nhe arrived in our land.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why defend him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I share the burden of guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.40,0:07:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The person who brought him here and\Nwho allowed him into the city...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It was me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Margaret, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.44,0:07:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, steal your fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.90,0:07:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It was not her fault! It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We found him knocked out and the\Nfloor is totally covered in mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought he was one of us,\Nso we brought him back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet Pea, Afalandra.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just as guilty as Margaret,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.10,0:08:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but under all those mushrooms,\Nwe just couldn't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It was an honest mistake, Empress.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, I won't let you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who said we should bring\Nhim back to the village, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she realize what she's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.52,0:08:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She's trying to be honest,\Nbut she's just being stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You were trying to kill me back there,\Nbut now I see you're actually pretty nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I bear the sole responsibility for\Nbringing the man here, Empress.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.42,0:08:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Margaret!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.14,0:08:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.60,0:08:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now lift your head,\Nhonest little Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.30,0:08:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Love, love, dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.14,0:09:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you keep quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.88,0:09:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.95,0:09:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I turned to stone. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.18,0:09:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,These three saved my life, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.93,0:09:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And now they have been justly\Npunished for their transgression?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.82,0:09:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn them back to normal now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it's time to\Nrelease Bekori. Bekori?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.06,0:09:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The man's already dead and\Nhe doesn't even know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to turn them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the female warrior\Nnation of Amazon Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, strength is regarded as true beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.42,0:09:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Show us what little\Nstrength you may possess,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.74,0:09:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and be grateful that I've\Ngiven you death in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind you stands the\Npanther known as Bekori.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.50,0:10:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The beast has served as the official\Nexecutioner of Amazon Lily for generations now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,When it's done, there won't be a\Nsingle bone left to remember you by.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All I care about is them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn them back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear how that savage was\Nspeaking to the snake princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.30,0:10:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ceremonic from Lynn Bekori!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Baccarat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.56,0:10:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's strong. He just knocked\NBekori out with a single blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And he didn't even use any Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.12,0:11:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That was just brute strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with all of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.46,0:11:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That woman up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She turned three of your\Nown people into stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you just sit up\Nthere and laugh like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.90,0:11:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I never!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That little savage has\Nthe gall to shout at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.64,0:11:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't lesser to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.86,0:11:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just an animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.28,0:11:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I feel sorry for those three,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but the Snake Princess had\Nevery right to do what she did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It was justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They violated the law of our land!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.48,0:11:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What you don't understand is that\NI'll be forgiven for anything I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And the reason why is\Nbecause I'm beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.70,0:11:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.10,0:11:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you must agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:11:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, you make me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.36,0:12:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This simply cannot be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no man alive that\Ncan resist my allure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So long as that man exists in this\Nworld I shall never know peace again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.86,0:12:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you hurt the\Nsnake princess like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.52,0:12:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Make the man suffer for his crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.64,0:12:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Execute him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.40,0:12:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Execute! Execute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Marigold, Sandersonia, defend\Nmy honor and take his head
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.90,0:12:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Execute! Execute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it. We'll get\Nthe job done, big sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.52,0:12:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So these girls have powers, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:13:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The sisters are about to\Nstart their snake pit dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen Mary Gold's\Nsalamander move before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, don't forget about\NSandersonia's egg-headed serpent!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.80,0:13:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They look fabulous when they transform!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.68,0:13:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course they do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's proof that they've slain the Gorgon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got great looks and\Npower and must run in the family!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.06,0:13:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a Gorgon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.52,0:13:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something I'm missing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.92,0:13:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just looks like they've\Neaten devil fruits to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.24,0:13:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.15,0:13:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.07,0:13:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'll just swallow him whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe squeeze him to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Grovel all you like, but\Nwe'll still destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.99,0:14:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not cracked, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.08,0:14:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.02,0:14:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Real sorry you got turned\Ninto stone because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If Chopper were here, maybe\Nhe could figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully you'll go back\Nto normal again somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.72,0:14:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,like after Aokiji turned\Nme and Robin into ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.14,0:14:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a kind gesture.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.06,0:14:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But you should be more\Nconcerned about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.82,0:14:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.73,0:14:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.26,0:14:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he trying to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.76,0:14:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's saving Margaret and\Nthe others from harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But why he's already been sentenced.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,to death all done okay which one of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you wants your ass kicked first what
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.84,0:14:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,a joke did he just
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.66,0:14:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,say what I think
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.57,0:14:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,he said if he thinks he can win he's\Nin for an ugly surprise hilarious
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:15:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,let's find more men to feed to the\Ngorgon sisters because this is too
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.40,0:15:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we still fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.98,0:15:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, why not? Love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you seem intent on winning this\Nbattle, let me give you a little warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.96,0:15:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't fall into that pit between\Nthe ring and the seats if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.68,0:15:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you could if you wanted to\Nbe impaled on razor-sharp blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.78,0:15:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blink.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.78,0:15:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Marigold and Sandersonia,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,execute him now for the\Ncrime of sneaking onto
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.98,0:15:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,our island and for\Npersonally offending me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.00,0:15:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Bestow on him the ultimate punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.26,0:15:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Will it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:15:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He may have some skill after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.06,0:16:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoo, Mooseboss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the way, Mara goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.50,0:16:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Crack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.26,0:16:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Powerful poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt me, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.78,0:16:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm made of progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.02,0:16:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Told ya, he's all bark and no bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.38,0:16:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But can all men stretch out\Nand whip around like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.90,0:16:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I not rubber anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:16:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.20,0:17:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did it hurt when she hit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.64,0:17:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're keeping him all to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got him now, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.08,0:17:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.00,0:17:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is hurting, too! Oh, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The same thing happened with that axe guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's exactly like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.74,0:17:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't think he\Nhad Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.18,0:17:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You have power just like me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A paramedia type from the look of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.18,0:17:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't use Haki then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.16,0:17:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Most outsiders never seem to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.36,0:17:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you're so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That left kick won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.76,0:17:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.30,0:17:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She knows what I'm about to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.98,0:17:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.74,0:17:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes! Crush him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.86,0:17:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That didn't hurt a bit. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.30,0:18:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum, step away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.48,0:18:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.92,0:18:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.40,0:18:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And with her Haki, she can see every\Nattack as soon as that loud thing sets up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.02,0:18:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really simple-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.28,0:18:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can read you like a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.26,0:18:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How is she doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get a punch in on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you're forgetting about someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.70,0:18:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake stick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.01,0:18:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.10,0:18:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You might fall off the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.04,0:18:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's falling into the pit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.10,0:18:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:18:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That was almost bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The snake princess just pushed\Nher hair back behind her ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.36,0:19:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Her beauty knows no bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the very definition\Nof all bark and no bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He is funny, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.74,0:19:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, lady! You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.18,0:19:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.22,0:19:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The audacity!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.70,0:19:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach him a lesson! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Steward the beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.62,0:19:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonia! Marigold!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.80,0:19:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tolerate him a moment longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.30,0:19:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We must ensure once and for all
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.14,0:19:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that his filthy outbursts are silenced.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you heard our big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:19:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pity we can't prolong your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.70,0:20:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, sister, but at the very least,\Nwe'll show him a taste of despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.45,0:20:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.82,0:20:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.02,0:20:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.84,0:20:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna end up breaking her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.26,0:20:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She saved your life. You\Nsaid then she deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,it there you have it sis we found a new
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,way to Make him suffer\Nbefore he dies don't
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,be stupid this is a duel\Nbetween you two and me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're the only\None who thought this was
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,a duel this is clearly a\Npublic execution Compared
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,to the trauma you caused\Nour poor sister this is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.12,0:20:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the least we can do to\Nyou In this proud nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,all of the women look up\Nto the Snake Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.34,0:20:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Her beauty is unparalleled.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.42,0:20:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's strong and noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She's called the Pirate\NEmpress, Boa Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.32,0:21:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how she felt?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.58,0:21:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She loves this country, and\Nthis is how you treat her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Empress is popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.74,0:21:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend would agree\Nwith her punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.16,0:21:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell she would!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.68,0:21:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.59,0:21:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of idiot? How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.50,0:21:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Such language.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.98,0:21:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It will turn these\Nself-sacrificing friends
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.04,0:21:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,of hers into pretty\Nlittle piles of rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.86,0:21:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Three... No! Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.68,0:21:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.74,0:21:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.22,0:21:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Margaret!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.74,0:21:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop! That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.32,0:22:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.23,0:22:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The warriors are fainting!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.78,0:22:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.69,0:22:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.88,0:22:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.66,0:22:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not cracked or broken or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.64,0:22:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, guess you're not so bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.68,0:22:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.48,0:22:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.88,0:22:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Unreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.94,0:22:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the Conqueror's spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.98,0:22:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.04,0:22:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one out of a million\Npeople can possess that Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.32,0:23:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let alone control it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.92,0:23:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone besides our\Nbig sister do something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.56,0:23:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This boy has the qualities of a Conqueror!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.18,0:23:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The ability to stand above all others!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.68,0:23:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.90,0:23:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.64,0:23:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He wields such power.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.52,0:23:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But who the hell is this boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.74,0:23:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he toying with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.78,0:23:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.40,0:23:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That didn't really just happen, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.76,0:23:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck's everyone babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.64,0:23:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.66,0:23:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I miss something?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.88,0:23:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he realizes\Nhe who's talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.06,0:23:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he doesn't know\Nhow to control it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.48,0:23:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.92,0:23:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.14,0:23:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You two girls are really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.22,0:23:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.18,0:23:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Round two.
